5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf peacefully. Does anyone have any ideas on how we should start?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Perhaps we should begin by observing each other's reactions and speech patterns; often, the truth hides in the smallest inconsistencies.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,"A wise suggestion, Benjamin. Patience and observation are our greatest allies. Let us listen to one another with open hearts and clear minds.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,I'm with Benjamin on this. Let's see who's trying too hard to be helpful and who's hiding something. I'll be watching you all very closely!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I don't see why we need to be so cautious. Let's just get straight to the point and figure out who the wolf is before anyone gets hurt!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"I agree with Takumi that we should be efficient, but I'm not sure how to do that without more information. Does anyone feel like they've noticed anything strange already?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is far too early for concrete evidence, Minato. However, I find it interesting how some of us are eager to rush while others prefer a measured approach. It is a subtle but telling distinction.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the tension between urgency and patience often reveals a person's inner state. Let us not mistake Takumi's passion for guilt, nor Benjamin's caution for secrecy.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"Exactly. Though, I must say, Servas is being awfully protective of everyone already. It's almost too sweet, don't you think?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being protective, I'm just saying we shouldn't waste time! And May, stop trying to play mind games and just tell us if you actually suspect someone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I don't want us to fight. Maybe we can all just share how we're feeling? I think we'll find the truth if we stay kind to each other.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Kindness is a virtue, Minato, but in a game of deception, it can also be a convenient veil. While I appreciate your sentiment, we must remain analytically detached to avoid being misled.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Balance is key, Benjamin. While logic is the sword that cuts through lies, empathy is the shield that protects the innocent. We must employ both to succeed.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"You're both sounding like philosophers today. It's lovely, really, but I'm more interested in who's actually sweating under the pressure. Minato, you're being awfully quiet and sweet—is that just you, or a strategy?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Leave Minato alone, May! He's just being himself. Why are you so obsessed with picking people apart instead of actually looking for the wolf?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"Thank you, Takumi. I'm just trying to keep us all calm. I don't have any suspicions yet, but I'll keep listening to everyone. I hope we can make a good decision tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent conclusion for today. I shall spend the coming hours reflecting on our initial exchanges. I wish you all a restful night, though I suspect some of us will be far more active than others.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,"May the night bring clarity to those who seek it and peace to those who are innocent. Sleep well, everyone; we shall face the truth together when the sun rises.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, everyone. I'll be dreaming of who's going to crack first tomorrow. See you in the morning!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah, whatever. Just make sure you're all ready to actually do something tomorrow. Goodnight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Benjamin,Minato,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Minato""}"
