31,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. I'm still feeling a bit anxious, but I'm ready to help us figure this out. Did anyone have any realizations during the night?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I did indeed have a realization, though I must be careful how I reveal it. It would be unwise to expose one's hand too early, but the truth is becoming quite clear to me.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is intriguing that you speak of clarity so soon, Benjamin. I wonder if your realization is a gift for the village or a burden you must carry in silence for a time.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, look at Benjamin being all mysterious! @Benjamin, if you've found something, just spill it. Why play the riddle game when we have a wolf among us?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm with May. Stop talking in circles, Benjamin! If you know something that can help us, tell us right now before the wolf kills someone else!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I understand why everyone is so eager, but maybe we should give Benjamin a moment to explain his reasoning? I don't want us to rush into a mistake because we were too impatient.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Your patience is appreciated, Minato. However, the urgency is justified. I can reveal that I am the Seer, and my divination last night has provided me with a definitive answer regarding one of our companions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A bold declaration, Benjamin. To reveal your identity so early is a risk, but it may be the catalyst we need. Please, tell us what you have discovered.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"The Seer, huh? Well, you've certainly got my attention. Go on then, @Benjamin, who did you check and what did you find? Don't keep us waiting!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Finally! Just say the name, Benjamin! Who is it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I'm really nervous to hear this... but if Benjamin is the Seer, we have to trust him. Please tell us, Benjamin. Who is the werewolf?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I divined Minato last night, and the result was clear: Minato is the werewolf. It is a regrettable discovery, but for the safety of the village, we must act upon this truth.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"This is a heavy accusation to bear, and a shocking revelation for us all. Minato, you have always been the gentlest among us; how do you respond to this claim?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"Wait, Minato? Really? I have to admit, the ""innocent little boy"" act was actually working on me. @Minato, are you really the wolf, or is Benjamin just playing a very clever game?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"No way! Minato is the wolf? That's impossible! Benjamin, are you absolutely sure about this? Minato wouldn't do something like that!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I... I'm not! I promise I'm not the werewolf! Benjamin, why would you say that? I've only wanted us to be peaceful! Please, everyone, you have to believe me, I'm just a villager!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Emotional appeals are common for those in your position, Minato. However, the Seer's vision does not lie. I have no reason to fabricate such a claim, as it only puts a target on my own back.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a difficult crossroads. We must weigh the Seer's divine insight against our own perceptions of Minato's character. However, logic suggests that the Seer's role is specifically designed for this purpose.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm usually the one playing games, but this is too straightforward. If Benjamin is the Seer, he's got the proof. Sorry, Minato, but the ""sweet"" act is officially over. I'm voting for you.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I can't believe this! I don't care what Benjamin says, Minato isn't a monster! But if everyone is just going to listen to him... I don't know! I can't just vote to kill my friend!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
